    <briefdescription>
<para>Atomic credit-event type. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class encapsulates the ISDA default contractual types and their combinations. Non-atomicity works only at the atomic type level, obviating the specific event characteristics which it is accounted for only in derived classes. </para>    </detaileddescription>
